<title>USA: Paradigm Medical names new CEO/president.</title>
<headline>Paradigm Medical names new CEO/president.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradigm Medical Industries Inc said Tuesday it has named Michael Stelzer chief executive and president.</p>
<p>Stelzer, a co-founder of the company, succeeds Thomas Motter, who remains chairman. Motter also is a co-founder.</p>
<p>Stelzer joined the company's board in April 1993 and served as general counsel for Paradigm Medical Inc from 1989 to 1993, until it merged with the company in May 1994.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
